<urn:atm:triage:finding/AY8-QA-003>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AY8-QA-003" ;
  triage:title "D8 cross-transport equivalence suite never built; ADR-058 fixture suite runs HerdrIo::Cli only, never Socket" ;
  triage:description "crates/atm-herdr/tests/transport_fixture.rs constructs every invoker via HerdrIo::Cli only (production_invoker_with_test_binary_and_environment); no helper builds a Socket-backed invoker. The ADR-058 fixture suite is never run against HerdrIo::Socket, so acceptance criterion 3 'both transports pass the same adapter equivalence suite' is unmet. Specification violation D8." ;
